<p>Amounts are in South African rand (ZAR). Dates are the system-recorded receipt, wallet debit or completed refund dates. Event dates are shown separately.</p>
<p>This statement covers entry and clothing payments recorded against your payer account, including sponsored players. Wallet funding and unused reservations are excluded. Hybrid payments appear as separate Wallet and PayFast receipts. Item fees describe the checkout and are not additional payments. A player filter includes the entire matching checkout; payment amounts are not allocated to individual players.</p>
<p>Only completed refunds recorded within the selected period reduce the net payments. A refund can relate to an earlier payment. Pending or waived refunds do not reduce these totals. This is an entry and clothing payment history, not a wallet balance, tax invoice or statement of outstanding fees.</p>
<p>Recorded category-change charges and wallet credits are included with entry fees. Unverified/private collections and payments awaiting reconciliation are excluded. Historical entries without identifiable payer payment records may be absent. Contact Cape Tennis if you need help reconciling older records.</p>
